      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Native subgraph prototype: edit the character on the left. Generation settings are on the middle node; IMAGE goes to Save Image. Double-click the subgraph to inspect its loaders, encoders, control application and sampler. The model-family button changes prompt formatting only: use the matching pipeline. The full custom DOM editor is deliberately kept outside; it is not a promoted scalar widget. This file is structurally unit-tested; no live UI or generation test has been run.\n\nThe creator negative_prompt output is connected to negative text encoding. SD/SDXL generate concise style/crop-aware negatives; Qwen currently outputs an empty negative. Disconnect this link to enter your own negative text."
      ],
      "title": "Compact workflow - start here"
    }
